{
  "clips": [
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "armor_break-brief-01",
      "speaker": "DALIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Vanguard's command group is preparing to link heavy weapons to the dormant Relay nodes. Break their military position and protect the relief corridor. We cannot trade the city's infrastructure for this victory.",
      "voiceId": "MK1Zvh93428YrgOQ8Obr",
      "voiceName": "Warline - Major Dalia Rahim",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH04M05ArmorBreak/Voice/en/armor_break-brief-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 13.52,
      "sha256": "ecc4412004ff4ad2c3ecc2e01cf4d077c37786d892a3ad0410b3f4c3be9d51c7",
      "captionSha256": "e19c1844ab6032c0f4abf280d09e3ff1351405fa109e3027d52107e5e78bff06"
    },
    {
      "deliveryProfile": "fa-conversational-v1",
      "voiceSettings": {
        "stability": 0.5,
        "similarity_boost": 0.75
      },
      "performanceDirection": "[conversational tone]",
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "armor_break-brief-01",
      "speaker": "DALIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "گروه فرماندهی ونگارد داره سلاح‌های سنگین رو به گره‌های خاموش رله وصل می‌کنه. موضع نظامیشون رو درهم بشکنین و مسیر امداد رو حفظ کنین. این پیروزی نباید به قیمت زیرساخت شهر تموم بشه.",
      "voiceId": "MK1Zvh93428YrgOQ8Obr",
      "voiceName": "Warline - Major Dalia Rahim",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH04M05ArmorBreak/Voice/fa/armor_break-brief-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 15.12,
      "sha256": "d36a07789f8a7c37e84bb05a9c360948545df650756c4c352910fdbae08816b5",
      "captionSha256": "dec6d0c61c3a48b0e7c8388276573b619f29ae4d47428a2c7ac08a67491c12bc"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "armor_break-brief-02",
      "speaker": "LAILA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Keep our armor, air defense, and long-range weapons working together. Fuel has been staged for this operation. Clear the military approach before moving the recovery team into the command compound.",
      "voiceId": "EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL",
      "voiceName": "Sarah (Captain Laila Nasser)",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH04M05ArmorBreak/Voice/en/armor_break-brief-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 11.6,
      "sha256": "7d392e5fb2355a92b0bba472e979669e316c73e99d62e188b637f482ab9a33ce",
      "captionSha256": "b681de096c57cf38b85fd9cdc167251c2a0719f67f72cf4240f7ea9671f28d79"
    },
    {
      "deliveryProfile": "fa-conversational-v1",
      "voiceSettings": {
        "stability": 0.5,
        "similarity_boost": 0.75
      },
      "performanceDirection": "[conversational tone]",
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "armor_break-brief-02",
      "speaker": "LAILA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "زرهی، پدافند هوایی و سلاح‌های دوربردمون باید هماهنگ کار کنن. سوخت این عملیات آماده شده. قبل از ورود تیم بازیابی به محوطهٔ فرماندهی، مسیر نظامی رو پاک‌سازی کنین.",
      "voiceId": "EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL",
      "voiceName": "Sarah (Captain Laila Nasser)",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH04M05ArmorBreak/Voice/fa/armor_break-brief-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 13.04,
      "sha256": "90d60ab904bd35ca61c75e529fcf1fd332e5da6613dfc815884e3d79ad63e86a",
      "captionSha256": "3d0b49503908c064c75dbba771fc4305d441ff2fb0a8fe3dd1078eb3358c0f08"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "armor_break-brief-03",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "The authority package is inside the command compound. Defeat the verified military targets, then recover the package. Optional support requires your confirmation for each action. I will mark targets without issuing orders.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH04M05ArmorBreak/Voice/en/armor_break-brief-03.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 14.16,
      "sha256": "55296f1074b8b576a49f21ed3651a4b36909b8d510a771fd90c68e5a427a89e3",
      "captionSha256": "492fdd2bdd5d26c3026988a103eebd094fd7edafd2b0b1b62bc1a84573ffeffb"
    },
    {
      "deliveryProfile": "fa-conversational-v1",
      "voiceSettings": {
        "stability": 0.5,
        "similarity_boost": 0.75
      },
      "performanceDirection": "[conversational tone]",
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "armor_break-brief-03",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "بستهٔ اختیار داخل محوطهٔ فرماندهیه. هدف‌های نظامی تأییدشده رو از بین ببر، بعد بسته رو بردار. هر اقدام پشتیبانی اختیاری به تأیید شما نیاز داره. هدف‌ها رو نشون می‌دم، بدون اینکه فرمان بدم.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH04M05ArmorBreak/Voice/fa/armor_break-brief-03.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 14.96,
      "sha256": "cd52d68efff2f7640cda1ae7b38e3e6c2dfdded3a82a32153011510f457c5c7a",
      "captionSha256": "98a11eeb974cc5c1e109d9714de649d16a94f8536dbaf2588f4f820450ccc25e"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "armor_break-comms-01",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "The link has begun. Its handshake asks for two keys. Commander, do you authorize one bounded support action? Use the existing Support controls if you choose it. I will wait for your confirmation; we can continue without it.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH04M05ArmorBreak/Voice/en/armor_break-comms-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 13.84,
      "sha256": "619f5a954ab3a72fb38084a7b750ab99de217badefcff534c1652620d26d10e9",
      "captionSha256": "fc12bb198e4337ecbb5b367ccd36da9bdae8b4d452c377c6ee95f97c1f1d7344"
    },
    {
      "deliveryProfile": "fa-conversational-v1",
      "voiceSettings": {
        "stability": 0.5,
        "similarity_boost": 0.75
      },
      "performanceDirection": "[conversational tone]",
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "armor_break-comms-01",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "اتصال شروع شده. برای برقراریش دو کلید می‌خوان. فرمانده، یک اقدام پشتیبانی محدود رو مجاز می‌دونین؟ اگه انتخابش می‌کنین، از کنترل‌های پشتیبانی استفاده کنین. منتظر تأییدتون می‌مونم؛ بدون اون هم می‌تونیم ادامه بدیم.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH04M05ArmorBreak/Voice/fa/armor_break-comms-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 16.48,
      "sha256": "73f36c6fbcc619bb6f3948df341b38ea74d00084021ad1ff0db23c9de940f7ff",
      "captionSha256": "fff7941cc697e2544fb29ef970fcf6203b4d45cc2baf36edd3df6c2953ca93c4"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "armor_break-comms-02",
      "speaker": "QASSEM",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "You can break my command group, Commander. You cannot keep the whole city apart. ARIA holds the system knowledge. You hold the emergency authority. Sahrin will bring both of you to the same door.",
