      "id": "armor_break-debrief-01",
      "speaker": "DALIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Vanguard's command group is broken. The authority package is secured and the relief corridor is intact. Keep the recovery team covered while we verify what they were trying to connect.",
