      "voiceName": "Warline - Major Dalia Rahim",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH04M05ArmorBreak/Voice/en/armor_break-close-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 11.52,
      "sha256": "45df376edcd1d87befc1a7ba6c0766f4f56a7ee4793056b4e7f852812a22c800",
      "captionSha256": "fd77cfa12fa1d9a7a77409572fb848183f986437ba86fcc533ab720fb25f0163"
    },
    {
      "deliveryProfile": "fa-conversational-v1",
      "voiceSettings": {
        "stability": 0.5,
        "similarity_boost": 0.75
      },
      "performanceDirection": "[conversational tone]",
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "armor_break-close-01",
      "speaker": "DALIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "این درخواست اتصالیه که گرفتیم. تجهیزات ونگارد می‌خواست به یکی از گره‌های خاموش رلهٔ شهری وصل بشه. بستهٔ اختیار، همون درخواست اصلی رو نگه داشته.",
      "voiceId": "MK1Zvh93428YrgOQ8Obr",
      "voiceName": "Warline - Major Dalia Rahim",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH04M05ArmorBreak/Voice/fa/armor_break-close-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 11.84,
      "sha256": "148361747ef2cd5dc5b92894ccad15679fdabc2e24e46d4a9b7aba8285d85f18",
      "captionSha256": "91b9df351a3b3ff506b4ad17a36ae7a2f65e913be9d66585b2964a45a770d40e"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "armor_break-close-02",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "The first key is my restored archive: the system knowledge needed to identify the Relay's nodes and control paths. Recovering that archive does not authorize me to use it against the city.",
